<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32868" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκσεύομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέσσῠμαι</span>: plpf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέσσῠτο</span> with sense of
		impf. (<i><span class="en">
			Od.
			9.373
		</span></i>), but usu. aor. (v. infr.) : aor. I
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεσύθην <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span></span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rush out</i> or <i>burst forth from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλέων ἐξέσσυτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρυγος δ᾽ ἐξέσσυτο οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.373
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλεφάρων ἐξέσσυτο νήδυμος
			ὕπνος</span> sleep <i>fled away from</i> his eyelids, <i><span class="en">
				12.366
			</span></i> : abs., <i>rush out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δ᾽ ἔσσυτο ιαός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.58
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομόνδ᾽ ἐξέσσυτο..μῆλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.438
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμὴ δ᾽ ἐξεσύθη</span> the
			point <i>burst out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.293
			</span></i> (v.l.) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέσσυται ἄνθρωπος ἐξ ἀνθρώπου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					32
				</span></i>
			.</div>
